On arbitrary curved metrics $g_{\mu\nu}$, the induction equation $\partial_t \mathcal{B}^i + \epsilon^{ijk} \partial_j \mathcal{E}_k = 0$ is discretized on a staggered Yee lattice where magnetic fluxes are face-centered and electric fields $\mathcal{E}_k$ are edge-centered:
